<title>BELGIUM: EU sets periodic sugar refunds.</title>
<headline>EU sets periodic sugar refunds.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's sugar management committee set the two weekly periodic sugar refunds on Wednesday, an EU member state official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The official said the refunds were set, in Ecus per 100 kg, as follows-</p>
<p> whites     41.160</p>
<p> raw sugar in its natural state  36.370  inulin syrup    78.20</p>
<p> ordinary syrup    41.160</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
